# Product photography in public/images/products/ is tracked, because products
# reference it directly: an uncommitted image 404s and the card falls back to
# generated artwork. Several files are unlicensed retail or press images kept
# for the prototype — see public/images/products/CREDITS.md and replace them
# with licensed assets before launch.

